96"]],"profile":{"sector":"Utilities","industry":"Utilities - Independent Power Producers","website":"https://www.jppowerventures.com","employees":1932,"summary":"Jaiprakash Power Ventures Limited engages in the power generation and cement grinding businesses in India. It generates electricity through thermal and hydro energy sources. The company owns and operates a 400 megawatts (MW) Jaypee Vishnuprayag hydro-electric power plant at District Chamoli, Uttarakhand; 1320 MW Jaypee Nigrie thermal power plant at village Nigrie, district Singrauli, Madhya Pradesh; and 500 MW Jaypee Bina thermal power plant at village Sirchopi, district Sagar, Madhya Pradesh. In addition, it operates coal mine located in Amelia and Bandha Madhya Pradesh, as well as Jaypee Nigrie cement grinding unit at Nigrie. The company was formerly known as Jaiprakash Hydro-Power Limited and changed its name to Jaiprakash Power Ventures Limited in December 2009. Jaiprakash Power Ventures Limited was incorporated in 1994 and is based in New Delhi, India.","officers":[{"name":"Mr. Ram Kumar Porwal","title":"CFO and Joint President of F&A","age":62,"pay":null},{"name":"Mr. Madan Gopal Gupta","title":"Chief Operating Officer","age":59,"pay":null},{"name":"Mr. Modali Kali Venkata Rama Rao","title":"Chief Technical Officer","age":70,"pay":null},{"name":"Mr. Mahesh Kumar Chaturvedi","title":"GM, Company Secretary & Compliance Officer","age":60,"pay":null},{"name":"Mr. Venkat Ramana Reddy Muthyala","title":"Chief of Project for Nigrie & Amelia","age":61,"pay":null},{"name":"Mr. Savan Jayendra Patel","title":"Additional Whole Time Director","age":null,"pay":null},{"name":"Mr. Ashok  Sharma","title":"Joint President (Comm)","age":66,"pay":null},{"name":"Major General Pankaj  Chauhan","title":"Senior VP & Unit Head of Vishnuprayag","age":39,"pay":null}]}}